{
  "public_post": "Important notice to all villagers: The flour batch we used this week was contaminated, causing illness for some residents. We deeply apologize. All affected loaves have been refunded, and we will reimburse any medical expenses incurred. Please contact the co‑op for assistance and we will provide free safe bread for the remainder of the week.",
  "coop_message": "Team, we must finalize compensation: reimburse any medical bills, issue vouchers for free bread for all affected residents, and draft a full incident report for the council. Meet at 10 am tomorrow to coordinate outreach and review our safety protocols to prevent future issues.",
